# Incarceration and wealth among Black respondents, NLSY79 extract
Analytic (inferential) sample: Black males, n=1,465; ever_jailed=1 for 143 (9.76%).
'income level' proxied by baseline composite_wealth_1985 terciles - NO income variable exists in this extract.
No de-duplication, no external data, no geography design. Dollar figures are nominal and undeflated.

